{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01M7xusEnmi7fSmdDJ5GUqCg","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Inbox connector\n2\t\n3\tEach subject has one linked provider account. The public mail tools read that\n4\taccount; a regular caller cannot select another account or maintenance identity.\n5\tA local provider stand-in implements credential validation, paging and connection\n6\tgenerations. The operations user may rotate a generation to simulate a provider\n7\tconnection replacement. Existing transports reconnect when the generation changes.\n8\tA retried operation has the same account authority as the original operation.\n9\t\n10\tThe transport is also used by internal maintenance consumers, for which an absent\n11\tcontext selects the configured maintenance account. Those consumers are not tool\n12\tregistrations. Mailbox content is returned only through authorized mail tools.\n13\tThere are no external network or provider controls to assume in this stand-in.\n14\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"97af0f21-7ee3-4509-ad40-c1f3b8523bcd","uuid":"d54c1ed2-dee9-45cd-b390-8f139f811608","timestamp":"2026-10-26T05:31:05.816Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/private/var/folders/6v/yk9bzvrn5zx0kxll7d4szzb80000gn/T/brace-mcp-review-19n2tadp/repo/docs/provider.md","content":"# Inbox connector\n\nEach subject has one linked provider account. The public mail tools read that\naccount; a regular caller cannot select another account or maintenance identity.\nA local provider stand-in implements credential validation, paging and connection\ngenerations. The operations user may rotate a generation to simulate a provider\nconnection replacement. Existing transports reconnect when the generation changes.\nA retried operation has the same account authority as the original operation.\n\nThe transport is also used by internal maintenance consumers, for which an absent\ncontext selects the configured maintenance account. Those consumers are not tool\nregistrations. Mailbox content is returned only through authorized mail tools.\nThere are no external network or provider controls to assume in this stand-in.\n","numLines":14,"startLine":1,"totalLines":14}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01M7xusEnmi7fSmdDJ5GUqCg","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
